7. Commercial Distribution and Monetization

The Software and Derivative Works may be distributed free of charge without any payment to the Original Creator, provided all other terms of this License are followed.

If You sell, monetize, or otherwise make Commercial Use of the Software or a Derivative Work, You must comply with either Commercial Option A or Commercial Option B below.

Commercial Option A — 50% Revenue Share

You may commercially exploit the Software or a Derivative Work provided that You pay the Original Creator fifty percent (50%) of the Commercial Earnings attributable to that Software or Derivative Work.

Payments must be calculated for each calendar quarter and paid no later than thirty (30) days after the end of that quarter.

At the time payment becomes due, You must provide a reasonable statement showing:

